      <h1 class="article-title">Resolutions</h1>
      <p class="article-dek faith-doc-dek">Jonathan Edwards &middot; 1722–1723</p>
      
      <p class="faith-doc-description">70 personal resolutions for holy living, written between ages 18 and 20.</p>
      <hr class="faith-doc-rule" aria-hidden="true">
      
      <p class="faith-format-downloads">
